ated statistics in B24:K27:")\nprint("    - Control Mean (row 24)")\nprint("    - Control StdDev (row 25)")\nprint("    - Treated Mean (row 26)")\nprint("    - Treated StdDev (row 27)")\nprint("3. ✓ Calculated fold changes in rows 32-41:")\nprint("    - Protein_ID (column A)")\nprint("    - Gene_Symbol (column B)")\nprint("    - Fold Change (column C)")\nprint("    - Log2 FC (column D)")\nprint("4. ✓ Preserved all formatting and colors")\nprint("5. ✓ Used formulas only, no hard-coded values")\n\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 1.0 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
