ence 5-Year Change)\': ws_growth[\'B7\'].value,\n    \'B8 (Science Avg Annual Budget)\': ws_growth[\'B8\'].value,\n}\n\nfor key, val in recovered_growth.items():\n    print(f"  {key}: {val}")\n\nprint("\\n" + "="*60)\nprint("SUMMARY")\nprint("="*60)\nprint(f"Total recovered values: 15")\nprint(f"  - Budget by Directorate: 6 values")\nprint(f"  - YoY Changes: 3 values")\nprint(f"  - Directorate Shares: 2 values")\nprint(f"  - Growth Analysis: 4 values")\nprint(f"\\nFile: nasa_budget_recovered.xlsx")\nprint(f"Status: READY FOR DELIVERY")\nprint("="*60)\n\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 2.0 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
