eight: 40px during loading\n\n7. SIDEBAR LOADING\n   Location: src/components/SidePane.tsx\n   Problem: Sidebar returned null, then appeared with w-220px, shifting content\n   Solution: Maintain fixed width with skeleton placeholders during loading\n\n================================================================================\n                            FILES MODIFIED (7 total)\n================================================================================\n\n✓ src/app/globals.css              - Added font-display: swap\n✓ src/components/Banner.tsx        - Reserve space during loading\n✓ src/components/LateBanner.tsx    - Reserve space during loading\n✓ src/components/ProductCard.tsx   - Add aspect-ratio to images\n✓ src/components/ProductList.tsx   - Use skeleton loaders during loading\n✓ src/components/ResultsBar.tsx    - Reserve space during loading\n✓ src/components/SidePane.tsx      - Reserve space during loading\n\n================================================================================\n                          VERIFICATION RESULTS\n================================================================================\n\n✅ Build Status: SUCCESSFUL\n   - All TypeScript types valid\n   - Zero compilation errors\n   - All pages prerendered correctly\n   - Production build optimized\n\n✅ Code Quality:\n   - No breaking changes to existing functionality\n   - All class names, ids, and data-testid preserved\n   - Semantic HTML maintained\n   - Accessibility features intact\n\n✅ Testing:\n   - All components render correctly\n   - Loading states display properly\n   - Final layouts match expected designs\n\n================================================================================\n                        PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENTS\n================================================================================\n\nCumulative Layout Shift (CLS):\n  - BEFORE: Multiple layout shifts during page load\n  - AFTER:  Stable layout maintained throughout loading\n\nPerceived Performance:\n  - BEFORE: Jittery, unstable experience\n  - AFTER:  Smooth, predictable loading with visual feedback\n\nCore Web Vitals Impact:\n  - Improved CLS score (major contributor to page experience)\n  - Better user experience metrics\n  - Reduced visual jank\n\n================================================================================\n                        BEST PRACTICES APPLIED\n================================================================================\n\n1. Font Optimization\n   - Used font-display: swap for non-blocking font loading\n   - Allows system font fallback during custom font load\n\n2. Image Optimization\n   - Reserved space with aspect-ratio before image loads\n   - Prevents CLS from image dimension changes\n\n3. Loading States\n   - Skeleton screens match actual content layout\n   - Provides visual feedback during data fetching\n   - Maintains consistent layout dimensions\n\n4. Space Reservation\n   - Used minHeight on dynamic components\n   - Prevents layout shift when content appears\n   - Maintains predictable layout flow\n\n5. Accessibility\n   - Preserved semantic HTML structure\n   - Maintained ARIA attributes and roles\n   - Kept data-testid attributes for testing\n\n================================================================================\n                            DEPLOYMENT READY\n================================================================================\n\nAll changes have been tested and verified:\n- Production build completes successfully\n- No errors or warnings\n- All existing functionality preserved\n- Ready for deployment\n\nDocumentation:\n- LAYOUT_SHIFT_FIXES.md - Detailed technical documentation\n- IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.txt - This file\n\n================================================================================\nEOF\ncat IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.txt\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.1 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
